<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin=""><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/academy.css"><script defer src="/assets/js/academy.js"></script><script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('portfolio-theme');document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t||(matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches?'dark':'light')}catch(e){}})()</script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/portfolio.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/master.css"><meta property="og:site_name" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio"><meta property="og:image" content="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/assets/images/bakhtawar-portfolio-social-v1.png"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/assets/images/bakhtawar-portfolio-social-v1.png"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio — Bakhtawar Khan. Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global."><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Mr. Bakhtawar Portfolio — Bakhtawar Khan. Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global."><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta property="og:title" content="Mr. Bakhtawar | Web Projects &amp; Portfolio"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Mr. Bakhtawar | Web Projects &amp; Portfolio"><meta property="og:description" content="Explore selected web, API and digital projects associated with MBK Global, with project descriptions and links where available."><meta name="twitter:description" content="Explore selected web, API and digital projects associated with MBK Global, with project descriptions and links where available."><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/identity.css"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/images/portfolio-icon-180.png"><link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest"></head><body data-page="projects.html" class="academy page-projects master-refresh"><header class="academy-header" id="top"><a class="academy-brand personal-brand" href="/"><span>Bakhtawar Khan<small>Personal Digital Portfolio · MBK Global</small></span></a><button class="academy-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="academy-nav">Menu <span>+</span></button><nav id="academy-nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href='/about'>About</a><a aria-current='page' href='/projects'>Projects</a><a href='/services'>Services</a><a class='header-cta' href='/hire-me'>Let’s talk <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><details class="portfolio-more"><summary>More</summary><div class="portfolio-panel"><section><h2>Professional work</h2><a href='/case-studies'>Case Studies</a><a href='/changelog'>Projects Changelog</a><a href='/delivered-project'>Process</a><a href='/resources'>Resources</a><a href='/news'>Notes</a></section><section><h2>Contact &amp; career</h2><a href='/book-a-call'>Book a Call</a><a href='/resume'>Resume / CV</a><a href='/hire-me'>Hire Me</a></section><section><h2>Content &amp; media</h2><a href='/gallery'>Gallery</a><a href='/blog'>Blog &amp; Articles</a><a href='/faq'>FAQs</a></section><section><h2>Personal brand</h2><a href='/about-muhammad-bakhtawar-khan'>Founder Profile</a><a href='/social'>Social Profiles</a><a href='/official-links'>Official Links</a></section></div></details><button class="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch color theme">◐</button></nav></header>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><main class="wrap inner-page academy-main" id="main-content"><section class="academy-page-hero"><div class="academy-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href='/resources'>Explore MBK</a></div><div class="academy-kicker">projects <span> / MBK GLOBAL</span></div><h1 class="page-title">Experiments made <em>real.</em></h1><p class="page-intro">A selected look at the digital spaces and experiments connected to MBK. Each project has its own purpose—from media and market interfaces to focused utilities. Features may evolve over time.</p></section><section class="ecosystem" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-title"><div class="ecosystem-heading"><p class="academy-kicker">THE PROJECT FAMILY / SEVEN DISTINCT IDEAS</p><h2 id="ecosystem-title">A connected digital<br><em>product ecosystem.</em></h2><p>Explore each product on its own terms. Linked destinations are existing project URLs, not a guarantee of current availability.</p></div><div class="ecosystem-grid"><article class="ecosystem-product product-0"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>TV</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Media discovery</p><h3>MBK TV</h3><p>An interface for discovering available television channels. Availability depends on the underlying content sources.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://mbktv.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-tv'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-1"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>01↗</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Data interfaces</p><h3>MBK Markets</h3><p>A market-data interface exploring cryptocurrency information and charts. Verify current sources before relying on data.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://mbkmarkets.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-markets'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-2"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>↓</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Web utilities</p><h3>MBK Video Downloader</h3><p>A link-based utility for supported media sources. Platform support and the current redirect destination need review.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://mbkdownloader.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-tools'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-3"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>Aa</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Creative tools</p><h3>MBK Text to Handwriting</h3><p>A separate utility that presents typed text in a handwriting-inspired format.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://handster.netlify.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-mbk-tools'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-4"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>نور</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Reading experiences</p><h3>Noor Quran</h3><p>A Quran-reading resource with a focus on calm, legible content presentation.</p><div class="product-actions"><a href="https://noorquranbymbk.vercel.app/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit project ↗</a><a href='/article-noor-e-quran'>Project context ↗</a></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-5"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>W</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">AI exploration</p><h3>Warm GPT by MBK Global</h3><p>Project name supplied by the owner. Description, implementation details and destination have not yet been provided.</p><div class="product-actions"><span class="project-pending">Details pending · Not linked</span></div></article><article class="ecosystem-product product-6"><div class="product-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>≋</span></div><p class="academy-kicker">Audio &amp; accessibility</p><h3>AI Text to Voice</h3><p>A text-to-audio direction related to the existing planned text-to-speech entry. No verified live destination is available.</p><div class="product-actions"><span class="project-pending">Details pending · Not linked</span></div></article></div></section><details class="legacy-projects"><summary>Earlier project descriptions &amp; additional experiments</summary><p class="eyebrow">SELECTED BUILDS / 02</p><div class="project-grid project-grid-page"><a class="project-card" href="https://mr-bakhtawar.netlify.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><div class="project-visual visual-global"><span class="visual-tag">00 / DIGITAL STUDIO</span><div class="global-word">MBK<small>GLOBAL</small></div><span class="visual-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-1">MBK Global</h3><p>A digital brand direction for creative work, web experiences and technology experiments.</p></div><span class="project-type">BRAND / WEB</span></div></a><a class="project-card" href="https://mbktv.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><div class="project-visual visual-tv"><span class="visual-tag">01 / MEDIA</span><div class="screen-mark">MBK<span>TV</span></div><span class="visual-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-2">MBK TV</h3><p>An online TV platform for watching available live channels such as ARY, Geo, Green TV and Dawat-e-Islami, with a focus on easy channel discovery.</p></div><span class="project-type">WEB PLATFORM</span></div></a><a class="project-card" href="https://mbkmarkets.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><div class="project-visual visual-market"><span class="visual-tag">02 / DATA</span><div class="chart-lines"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><span class="market-word">MARKETS<span> / LIVE DATA CONCEPT</span></span><span class="visual-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-3">MBK Markets</h3><p>A cryptocurrency market platform featuring 10,000+ coins, live market information and interactive candlestick charts to explore price movements and market trends.</p></div><span class="project-type">DATA UI</span></div></a><a class="project-card" href="https://mbkdownloader.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><div class="project-visual visual-download"><span class="visual-tag">03 / UTILITY</span><div class="download-icon">↓<small>GET YOUR FILE</small></div><span class="visual-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-4">MBK Downloader</h3><p>A link-based video downloader for supported platforms including YouTube, Instagram, Facebook and TikTok. Available downloads and quality options depend on platform support.</p></div><span class="project-type">WEB TOOL</span></div></a><a class="project-card" href="https://noorquranbymbk.vercel.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><div class="project-visual visual-quran"><span class="visual-tag">04 / LEARNING</span><div class="quran-mark">نور <small>QURAN</small></div><span class="visual-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-5">Noor-e-Quran</h3><p>An online Quran-reading website with a calm, readable interface for accessing Quran content.</p></div><span class="project-type">CONTENT</span></div></a><a class="project-card" href="https://handster.netlify.app/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><div class="project-visual visual-hand"><span class="visual-tag">05 / CREATIVE TOOL</span><div class="handwritten">Make text<br>feel personal.</div><span class="visual-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-6">Text to Handwriting</h3><p>A creative utility that transforms typed text into a handwriting-inspired presentation.</p></div><span class="project-type">WEB TOOL</span></div></a><a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/Muhammad-Bakhtawar-Khan" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><div class="project-visual visual-code"><span class="visual-tag">06 / OPEN WORK</span><div class="code-mark">&lt;/&gt;</div><span class="visual-arrow">↗</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-7">More experiments</h3><p>Browse repositories and code experiments.</p></div><span class="project-type">GITHUB</span></div></a><div class="project-card upcoming-project"><div class="project-visual upcoming-visual"><span class="visual-tag">07 / IN DEVELOPMENT</span><div class="upcoming-symbol">Aa<span>↗</span></div><span class="upcoming-status">COMING SOON</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-8">MBK Text to Speech</h3><p>A planned text-to-audio tool focused on making written content easier to listen to.</p></div><span class="project-type">AI / ACCESSIBILITY</span></div></div>
<div class="project-card upcoming-project"><div class="project-visual upcoming-visual"><span class="visual-tag">08 / IN DEVELOPMENT</span><div class="upcoming-symbol">#<span>↗</span></div><span class="upcoming-status">COMING SOON</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-9">MBK Number to Info</h3><p>A planned utility for looking up useful information from supported number formats and sources.</p></div><span class="project-type">WEB UTILITY</span></div></div>
<div class="project-card upcoming-project"><div class="project-visual upcoming-visual"><span class="visual-tag">09 / IN DEVELOPMENT</span><div class="upcoming-symbol">DP<span>↗</span></div><span class="upcoming-status">COMING SOON</span></div><div class="project-info"><div><h3 id="section-10">MBK DP Finder</h3><p>A planned profile-image discovery tool with a simple, focused search experience.</p></div><span class="project-type">SEARCH TOOL</span></div></div>
